              "start": 43
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether U.S. actors have an obligation to conform their conduct to constitutional norms."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ea1aa2f8b5f1c1178a6f75e529b90eff828a1bbb579b2f264969071016c3286a",
